Model "All Forms" {description: "Each sentence form of juiz-OPL once."}.

A is an object.
A can be s1, s2, or "almost done".
A is initially s1 and finally s2 or "almost done".
State s1 of A is default [status: planned].
State s2 of A {description: "the second state"}.

Alice is an environmental physical object.

Animal is an object.
Dog is an Animal.

B is an object.
B is located in C, and C contains B.

Battery is an object.

Bob is an environmental physical object.

C is an object.

Camera 2 is a physical object.
Camera 2 consists of 2 to 4 Lens.
Camera 2 consists of 2 to many Screw.
Camera 2 consists of 3 Leg.
Camera 2 consists of an optional Strap.
Camera 2 consists of at least one Battery {ordered: true}.
Camera 2 consists of optional Filter.
Camera 2 exhibits Weight.

Dog is an object.
Rex is an instance of Dog.

Filter is an object.

Leg is an object.

Lens is an object.

"Model Train" is an object.

P is a process {duration_min: 1, duration_expected: 2.5, duration_max: 4, duration_unit: s}.
P consumes s1 A.
P occurs if B exists, in which case P consumes B, otherwise P is skipped.
P changes A from s1 to s2.
P yields either X or Y.
Alice handles P.
Bob initiates and handles P.
P requires C [arg: c, arg_index: 0, connection: push, connection_name: "c,p"].
P invokes Q.
P invokes itself.
R occurs if duration of P exceeds 4 s.

Q is a process {duration_min: 2, duration_max: 9, duration_unit: min}.
Q consumes exactly one of B, C, or X.
A initiates Q, which changes A from s2.
Q occurs if A is s1, in which case Q changes A from s1 to "almost done", otherwise Q is skipped.
Following path p1, Q yields Y.
Either Alice or Bob handles Q.
Q occurs if A is s2, otherwise Q is skipped.
R occurs if duration of Q falls short of 2 min.

R is a process.
R zooms into P, parallel Q and S, and T, in that sequence, as well as X.

Rex is an object.

S is a process.
A initiates S, which affects A.
S affects A.
S occurs if A exists, in which case S affects A, otherwise S is skipped.
s2 A handles S if A is s2, otherwise S is skipped.
S requires at least one of B or C.
s1 A initiates S, which requires s1 A.

Sarah is a physical object.
Sarah and "Model Train" are family.

Screw is an object.

Strap is an object.

T is a process.
s1 A initiates T, which consumes s1 A.
T changes A to s2.

U is a process.
U zooms into nothing, as well as A and B.

Weight is an object.

X is an object [role: value, datatype: juiz.Image, value: {"a":[1,2]}, rate: 0.5, use_memo: true, translation: 0.1 0 0.5, rotation: 0 0 0 1, writers: arm base, params: {"initial_value":3}, default: "x y", status: in_progress, refs: juiz#376 juiz#418].
X zooms into Y.

Y is an object.
